% Scenario: a guarded job. With a backend installed pdfmark is defined
% and the mark is honoured: the .ir golden ends in a doc section with
% the document information. guarded-idiom-no-backend.ps runs the same
% program without a backend, where the guard installs cleartomark.
% expect-output: done
/pdfmark where { pop } { userdict /pdfmark /cleartomark load put } ifelse
[ /Title (Guarded) /DOCINFO pdfmark
72 72 moveto 300 72 lineto stroke
(done) =
showpage
